# Quick start runner is constant

Do not edit `quick_starts/run.mjs`. It is the e2e harness.

E2E is the consumer workflow: `npx @deterministic-code/datasources-cli` in a temp project, published packages, Docker when the suite says so. Do not point the runner at this repo’s CLI, add timeouts, kill `tsx`, rewrite commands, or filter languages to hide a failure.

Fix the published library, generator, or sample. Then run `node quick_starts/run.mjs`.
